{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>{'text': '「三十載相伴，珍重再相逢」，車頭顯示版打出告別字句，自 1997 年 3 月起，服務近 30 年，往返香港落馬洲與深圳皇崗口岸的跨境巴士「皇巴」，今日（12日）清晨 6 時 15 分，由新田公共運輸交匯處，開出最後一班車。有巴士迷和乘客，到場向告別。'}</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261012_HuangBus-01-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261012_HuangBus-02-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261012_HuangBus-03-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261012_HuangBus-04-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261012_HuangBus-5-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261012_HuangBus-06-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261012_HuangBus-07-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261012_HuangBus-08-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261012_HuangBus-09-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>{'text': '有市民手持自己計劃的標語，寫上「皇巴士，珍重，再見」，「服務大家近 30 載，係時候要講聲 bye bye」，有人帶來了自製的「皇巴士」遙控模型車前來道別。有搭客難忘這裏曾經出現的「皇巴」盛世，30 年的服務，有過要排長龍，不斷「打蛇餅」的時刻，在 2006 年的高峰期，「皇巴士」的日均載客量近五萬人次。'}</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261012_HuangBus-10-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>{'text': '新皇崗口岸正式啟用後，「皇巴士」完成歷史任務。九巴有三條新的新皇崗口岸路線，接載乘客往返兩地。皇崗口岸重建後，今日上午 6 時 30 分正式運作，24 小時運作，通關流量為每日 20 萬人次，港鐵北環線支線日後通車，可提升至每日 30 萬人次。'}</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261012_HuangBus-11-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T09:59:46.485031+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":438,"images":12,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T05:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T22:17:38.146740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T09:58:02.786506+00:00","content_hash":"07e5efa5703757ccd38db30a54b09f128fa5245870a74ecde410efd6a8e7e23f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}